# Kept in git. Left out of the deploy.
#
# These are V1/V2 source clips, superseded derivatives, docs and encode scripts. AGENTS.md
# requires the originals and their provenance stay in the repository, so nothing here is
# deleted — it is simply not uploaded to Vercel, because the page never requests it.
# 147.6 MB of a 302.5 MB tree, so the deploy carries 154.9 MB instead.
#
# EXPLICIT PATHS, NOT GLOBS, ON PURPOSE. A glob that drifts silently 404s a shot in the film.
# This list was generated by taking every tracked file whose BASENAME appears nowhere in
# index.html, css/, js/, scripts/ or the docs — a deliberate superset of "used", so that a clip
# referenced from a custom attribute (data-trip=) or assembled as a string in JS still counts as
# used and still ships. Three are-ready-*.mp4 panels were caught exactly that way.
#
# Adding a clip needs no change here. Removing a beat should be followed by re-running the
# reference audit rather than hand-editing this file.

.gitignore
AGENTS.md
css/main.css
docs/HERO-SPINE-ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/MEDIA-MANIFEST.md
docs/S01-BACKGROUND.md
docs/S01-S02-PRESENTATION.md
docs/S02-VIDEO.md
